  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.24\n- Adds the Uno Platform integration for Firebase Installations. UseUno() delegates to the platform package that matches the Uno head the application is running on: Installations.Browser on WebAssembly, Installations.Android on Android, Installations.Apple on iOS and Mac Catalyst, and Installations.Windows on Windows.\n- The package references no Uno package and stays framework-independent, exactly as the .Maui packages reference no MAUI package. The head is detected at runtime, so the browser and Skia-desktop heads share the plain net10.0 asset.\n- Fails fast with UnoFirebaseInstallationsException on the Skia desktop head, including Linux, because FireForNet ships no desktop integration packages.",
